## 2. Component Library

### Where components live

- **Package:** `packages/ui`
- **Paths:**
  - Components: `packages/ui/src/components/*.tsx` (e.g. `button.tsx`, `input.tsx`, `sidebar.tsx`)
  - Primitives / composition: `packages/ui/src/ui/*.tsx`
  - Icons: `packages/ui/src/icons/*.tsx`
  - Utils: `packages/ui/src/lib/utils.ts` (`cn`), `packages/ui/src/lib/*.ts`
  - Hooks: `packages/ui/src/hooks/*.tsx`
  - Image: `@vtrip/image`

### Component architecture

- **Primitives:** Base UI (`@base-ui/react`) and Radix-style primitives where used.
- **Variants:** `class-variance-authority` (`cva`) for variant/size combinations.
- **Class merging:** `cn(...)` from `@vtrip/ui/lib/utils` (clsx + tailwind-merge).

**Import aliases (from `components.json`):**

- Components: `@vtrip/ui/components/<name>` (e.g. `@vtrip/ui/components/button`)
- Utils: `@vtrip/ui/utils/cn` or `@vtrip/ui/lib/utils`
- Hooks: `@vtrip/ui/hooks/<name>`
- Icons: `@vtrip/ui/icons` (barrel; all icons and `IconProps` re-exported)
- Image: `@vtrip/image`

**Example (Button):**

```tsx
import { Button } from "@vtrip/ui/components/button"
import { cn } from "@vtrip/ui/lib/utils"

;<Button variant="default" size="sm">
  Label
</Button>
```

- Use semantic variants: `default`, `outline`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `destructive`, `link`.
- Use size tokens from the component (e.g. `xs`, `sm`, `default`, `lg`, `icon`, `icon-sm`, `icon-lg`) rather than arbitrary Tailwind height/width when a variant exists.

### Documentation

- **No Storybook** in the repo. Prefer existing `@vtrip/ui` components; add new ones in `packages/ui/src/components/` following the same patterns (Base UI or primitive + `cva` + `cn`).

