## 7. Project Structure

### Monorepo layout

- **Tooling:** pnpm workspaces, Turbo.
- **Apps:** `apps/web` (main React Router app), `apps/_templates` (template app).
- **Packages:**
  - `packages/ui` — design system components and icons
  - `packages/blocks` — layouts, shared, domains (uses `@vtrip/ui`)
  - `packages/core`, `packages/lib`, `packages/api`, `packages/utils`, `packages/env`
- **Tooling packages:** `tooling/tailwind` (theme + PostCSS), `tooling/eslint`, `tooling/prettier`, `tooling/typescript`

### Feature organization

- **Web app routes:** Under `apps/web/app/routes/` (file-based routing with React Router).
- **Shared UI:** Always in `packages/ui`; app and `packages/blocks` depend on `@vtrip/ui` and `@vtrip/tailwind-config`.
- When implementing features from Figma, always confirm which app under `apps/{app_name}` (e.g. `apps/web`, `apps/hotel`) the change targets and keep routes and assets scoped to that app.
- **Adding components:** Add to `packages/ui`; add new shadcn components via `pnpm ui-add` (runs shadcn CLI in the UI package).

